async function getAllLibrarySongs(){const all=[],ids=new Set();for(let offset=0;;){const data=await api('search3',{query:'',songCount:500,songOffset:offset,albumCount:0,artistCount:0}),received=data.searchResult3?.song||[];const fresh=received.filter(song=>!ids.has(song.id));for(const song of fresh){ids.add(song.id);all.push(song);}offset+=received.length;if(received.length<500||!fresh.length)break;}return all;}
